  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Boil the kettle.<br>• Cut Malaysian tofu into 2cm cubes.<br>• Thinly slice carrot and zucchini into half-moons. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69d84216defeabaeea85c65f/step-5e9eee00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water.<br>• Cook egg noodles over medium-high heat, stirring occasionally with a fork to separate, until tender, 4-5 mins.<br>• Drain, rinse and set aside.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69d84216defeabaeea85c65f/step-57523810.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, in a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.<br>• Cook tofu, turning until browned, 3-4 mins. Transfer to a bowl and cover to keep warm.<br>• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.<br>• Cook carrot and zucchini until slightly softened, 4-5 mins.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69d84216defeabaeea85c65f/step-9f034a20.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Add coconut milk, green curry powder, the water, soy sauce, brown sugar and vinegar to the veggies. Simmer until slightly reduced, 1-2 mins.<br>• Remove from heat and stir through cooked egg noodles. Season to taste.<br>• Divide green curry noodles between bowls. Top with crispy tofu to serve.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69d84216defeabaeea85c65f/step-41ac2b30.jpeg"
    }
  ]
